WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:03.169
I know!

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:05.714
There he is!

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:08.425
Yo, Mozart!

00:00:08.633 --> 00:00:11.094
I got to hear one of your songs.

00:00:11.177 --> 00:00:14.347
You know, your K. 280 is pretty good!

00:00:21.229 --> 00:00:24.357
Mr. Ajino chose Kai.

00:00:27.027 --> 00:00:27.861
Hm?

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:37.579
Ichinose?

00:00:46.755 --> 00:00:47.797
Ajino!

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:53.720
You've got some nerve showing up
here after skipping today.

00:00:53.928 --> 00:00:55.764
Did you come to see me?

00:00:56.347 --> 00:00:58.224
No way!

00:00:58.308 --> 00:01:01.061
I just came here to look at Mozart!

00:01:01.144 --> 00:01:03.438
-Is that Mozart?
-Huh?

00:01:05.273 --> 00:01:06.608
No, I mean...

00:01:06.691 --> 00:01:09.194
This man is... um...

00:01:09.277 --> 00:01:10.278
Beethoven!

00:01:11.154 --> 00:01:13.740
Here is one of Beethoven's songs.

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:20.038
This is called "Für Elise."

00:01:29.464 --> 00:01:33.051
This is his "Symphony No. 5," known
as "Destiny" here in Japan.

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:35.678
I know that one!

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:39.599
Then what about this guy?

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.601
That's Chopin.

00:01:42.185 --> 00:01:43.019
Chopin!

00:01:43.103 --> 00:01:45.605
Chopin has many famous songs.

00:01:45.688 --> 00:01:49.442
For example,
"Waltz in D flat major, Op. 64, No. 1"

00:01:49.526 --> 00:01:50.860
"The Minute Waltz."

00:02:14.759 --> 00:02:16.010
Chopin!

00:02:16.719 --> 00:02:19.222
So this is... Chopin!

00:02:19.764 --> 00:02:21.391
That was so cool!

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:24.269
Play it again! Play it one more time!

00:02:24.394 --> 00:02:25.812
You like Chopin?

00:02:25.895 --> 00:02:28.022
Yeah, that was awesome!

00:02:28.106 --> 00:02:28.940
I see.

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:31.401
Wanna give it a try?

00:02:32.527 --> 00:02:34.863
What are you talking about?
I can't play it.

00:02:34.946 --> 00:02:36.489
No need to be modest.

00:02:36.573 --> 00:02:38.408
-You should have it memorized already.
-Huh?

00:02:39.033 --> 00:02:42.537
If you can play the song you did
in the forest, then you can play this.

00:02:42.787 --> 00:02:45.832
I can only play the piano in the forest.

00:02:45.915 --> 00:02:47.375
I can't play normal pianos.

00:02:47.458 --> 00:02:49.836
Ah, I see.

00:02:50.044 --> 00:02:51.796
The piano in the forest
is special after all.

00:02:53.381 --> 00:02:57.177
Once you get the hang of it, you'll be
playing normal pianos in no time.

00:02:57.427 --> 00:03:00.555
Why don't you try playing Chopin
on this piano?

00:03:00.638 --> 00:03:02.015
I'll watch you.

